        "x": -80,
        "y": -480
      },
      "width": 720,
      "height": 320,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Baseline\n\nThis graph starts with two nodes.\n\nDrop the Port Provider’s cyan handle here. The result should be one new Portal—not a Task node—whose target is `port-provider/root.node`, node `task-port`, surface `tasks`.\n\nClear or reload the workspace to reset the fixture."
      }
